  "integration_decisions": [
    "Keep the existing generation/configuration/incarnation-bound document-family fragment protocol, including asset families; do not run a second sequence/offset cursor protocol.",
    "Keep exclusive path-owned allocator loans as the primary path; the copied-ledger API is a cold fallback. Both measured importer runs used zero ledger copies.",
    "Combine outcome receipts with existing commit/mutation dispositions in all embedded SDKs. Preserve the pre-commit-only batch capacity retry and request-owned response buffer.",
    "Keep uncertain Lite owners fenced; resolve a receipt through a fresh handle after close/reopen. Named-table receipts carry their durable table id and fail closed after replacement.",
    "Validate a fresh checkpoint after admission validation that can publish control records. Keep index-read fences.",
    "Attribute successful and refused writer holds by site under the owner gate. Restore original outermost publication-hold/controller feedback alongside these new counters and verify nested release does not charge twice.",
    "Preserve per-key changing-word visibility checks when benchmarking multi-document batches."
